<title>USA: ADC Telecom, Nanjing Panda form venture.</title>
<headline>ADC Telecom, Nanjing Panda form venture.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADC Telecommunications Inc said Tuesday it signed an agreement with  Nanjing Panda Electronics Co Ltd to form the first joint venture in China for providing hybrid fiber coax technology for use in telephone and data services delivery.</p>
<p>The joint venture, named Nanjing ADC Broadband Communications Co Ltd, will market ADC's Homeworx platform.</p>
<p>Total capitalization of the venture is $10 million, and ADC will own 60 percent of the venture.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
